{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/638517-our-own-p-tc-2-with-blackjack-and-hookers-joke","id":638517,"title":"Our own P:tC 2 - With blackjack and hookers [JOKE]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-24T17:42:44-07:00","id":638517,"title":"Our own P:tC 2 - With blackjack and hookers [JOKE]","content":"So since Matt didn't yet gave us another bite at the new Promethean edition, I decided it was time we create our own 2nd edition spoilers. Here's a quick list of the major changes in the new edition:<ul><li>Prometheans are now mandatory Frankenstein, to better fit the core origin of the game line.</li> <li>Prometheans can now gouge their own Pyros from their open chest and throw it like fireballs</li> <li>In an attempt to level the battlefield between the Prometheans and the Mages, Prometheans now have access to Spontaneous Alchemy, distributed in 10 Colleges. Spontaneous Alchemy triggers a backlash response from the universe itself called Blas.</li> <li>Elvis is now an iconic character. Frankenstein, like every Created. He can be found in a new playable city: La Habana</li> <li>Prometheans must now go through many fixed Milestones, including murder, crying yourself to sleep, writing slam poetry and cursing the gods for your fate</li> <li>Wasteland, Disquiet and Torment reworked to better suit the narrative.<ul><li>Everyone now instantly wants to murder you with the nearest metallic implement</li> <li>Every step a Created takes fractures the land below him.</li> <li>Talking to any mortal instantly kills it.</li> </ul></li> <li>Torment now acts in a similar way to Death Rage or Frenzy - boosting your stats while making sure you kill everyone</li> <li>Feminine Created characters can now choose between Hooker, Stripper or Wandering Artists as career choices</li> <li>Masculine Created characters can now choose between serial killer, Grave Diggers or Truckers</li> </ul>Add your own!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-24T17:52:09-07:00","id":638540,"title":"","content":"<ul><li>The game is now about transhumanism and the inherent benefit of having a thousand turgid wangs.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-24T18:24:25-07:00","id":638587,"title":"","content":"<ul><li>Shouting &quot;FIRE BAD&quot; negates the Promethean's weakness to fire for 1 turn.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-26T06:37:31-07:00","id":640124,"title":"","content":"<ul><li>The Principle can now be one of two things (depending on the needs of the game). The God-Machine, as previously hinted at in the ending chapter of Saturnine Nights, or the Dark Mother. This is to better tie all mythologies into a cohesive whole. Quashmals are now either Angels or Spirits, depending on the nature of the Principle.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"fo